  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohd. Masood vs State Of U.P. on 18 November, 2025 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:205610 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Application U/S 528 Bnss No. - 40476 of 2025 Mohd. Masood .....Applicant(s) Versus State of U.P. .....Opposite Party(s) Counsel for Applicant(s) : Aadesh Kumar Srivastava Counsel for Opposite Party(s) : G.A. Court No. - 76",
    "facts": "2. This application has been filed by applicant for a direction to the court concerned not to take any coercive measures arising out of Complaint Case No.686 of 2000, State Vs. Munna, under Section 7/16 of Prevention of Food Adulteration (PFA) Act, 1954, Police Station Dhoomanganj, District Allahabad which is pending in the court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Court No.2, Allahabad.",
    "arguments": "3. It is submitted by learned counsel for the applicant that proceedings under Section 82 Cr.P.C. has been drawn against one Munne. 4. Learned A.G.A. has objected to the aforesaid and submits that the applicant is Munne and the applicant is concealing its identity.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. It is submitted by learned counsel for the applicant that proceedings under Section 82 Cr.P.C. has been drawn against one Munne. 4. Learned A.G.A. has objected to the aforesaid and submits that the applicant is Munne and the applicant is concealing its identity.",
